<title>INDIA: CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND 220-9 IN 50 OVERS V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND 220-9 IN 50 OVERS V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>BANGALORE, India 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand scored 220</p>
<p>for nine in their 50 overs in the Independence Cup match against</p>
<p>India on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
